{"seq":4,"slug":"cosmology","title":"宇宙学","stage":"DONE","category":"astronomy-cosmology","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/cosmology","rating":{"composite":3.71,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.15,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 宇宙学\n\n宇宙学（Cosmology）是研究宇宙整体结构、起源、演化与最终命运的物理学分支。它以广义相对论为理论基础，结合粒子物理学与天文观测，构建描述宇宙从大爆炸到今天加速膨胀的完整图景。\n\n## 核心内容\n\n本 Hub 涵盖现代宇宙学的四大支柱：\n\n| 章节       | 主题                                   | 核心问题                             |\n| ---------- | -------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 宇宙学框架 | Friedmann 方程、Hubble 膨胀、ΛCDM 模型 | 宇宙如何膨胀？标准模型如何描述宇宙？ |\n| 早期宇宙   | 大爆炸核合成、暴胀、CMB 物理           | 宇宙最初几分钟发生了什么？           |\n| 暗宇宙     | 暗物质、暗能量、修改引力               | 宇宙 95% 的成分是什么？              |\n| 前沿问题   | Hubble 张力、原初引力波、多宇宙        | 标准模型面临哪些挑战？               |\n\n## 学习路径\n\n```mermaid\ngraph LR\n    A[宇宙学框架] --> B[早期宇宙]\n    B --> C[暗宇宙]\n    C --> D[前沿问题]\n    A --> C\n```\n\n建议先掌握 Friedmann 方程与 ΛCDM 模型的基本框架，再深入早期宇宙物理过程，然后探索暗物质与暗能量的本质，最后关注当前未解决的前沿问题。\n\n## 前置知识\n\n- 广义相对论基础（度规、Einstein 场方程）\n- 热力学与统计物理\n- 粒子物理标准模型基础\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cosmological-framework","title":"宇宙学框架","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/cosmology/cosmological-framework","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"friedmann-equations","title":"弗里德曼方程与宇宙动力学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/cosmology/cosmological-framework/friedmann-equations"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cosmic-expansion-hubble","title":"宇宙膨胀与哈勃常数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/cosmology/cosmological-framework/cosmic-expansion-hubble"},{"seq":3,"slug":"lambda-cdm-model","title":"ΛCDM 标准模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/cosmology/cosmological-framework/lambda-cdm-model"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"early-universe","title":"早期宇宙","docCou